anagement by reducing cravings and appetite fluctuations.*<br></i><br><br><strong>Ginger Root Extract<br></strong><br>Ginger contains bioactive compounds like gingerols and shogaols that inhibit prostaglandin synthesis via COX and LOX pathways. This anti-inflammatory action helps reduce menstrual cramps and digestive discomfort.<br> <br><i>Helps: Aids in managing occasional cramps, supports digestive wellness, and promotes natural cycle comfort.*<br></i><br><br><strong>Aniseed Extract<br></strong><br>Aniseed has carminative and antispasmodic properties that relax gastrointestinal muscles, alleviating bloating, cramps, and other digestive discomforts.<br><br><i>Helps: Promotes soothing comfort during cyces, supports digestion, and eases occasional tension.*<br></i><br><br><strong>Turmeric Root Extract<br></strong><br>Curcumin in turmeric has anti-inflammatory properties that help reduce menstrual discomfort by targeting inflammatory pathways and promoting bile production to alleviate bloating.*<br><br><i>Helps: Promotes comfort during cycles, supports natural inflammation balance, and aids in managing bloating.*</i></p></span></div></div></div></div><div data-rid="ff770a0a-150d-417a-aed7-322741561c64" data-replo-repeated-index=".0.0.0.0.0.0" class="r-dh4ftb" data-replo-collapsible="true" data-state="closed" data-orientation="vertical"><div data-rid="b93bf783-2250-4552-bbd2-1dd243745785" aria-expanded="false" aria-controls="replo-:R1abj2:" data-replo-repeated-index=".0.0.0.0.0.0.0" tabindex="0" role="button" class="r-1tqytoo"><div data-rid="427c682d-cac5-4321-89dd-d1ac0d4537fa" data-replo-repeated-index=".0.0.0.0.0.0.0.0" class="r-1215j4d alchemy-rte" style="--replo-library-7229a9be-0ff2-4194-85c2-a9c88cbfa244-styles-60caf70d-2745-48ff-ac0b-fd7f96435b41-attributes-color:#2A2A2A;--replo-library-7229a9be-0ff2-4194-85c2-a9c88cbfa244-styles-60caf70d-2745-48ff-ac0b-fd7f96435b41-attributes-fontsize:20px;--replo-library-7229a9be-0ff2-4194-85c2-a9c88cbfa244-styles-60caf70d-27